WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:04.580
What’s up guys, my name is Colin McNeil for theScore esports.

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:08.500
Last week we brought you the Top 10 One Taps in CS:GO.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.280
Now that included rifle one taps, and one deags.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:18.400
But you guys let us know in the comment section that we should do an entire list devoted to just one deags.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.140
Well you asked, and we delivered. Before we get into it though,

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:27.960
I'm gonna need you to buy up that deagle, and give the subscribe button just one tap, thank you very much.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:32.680
Without further or do, here are the Top 10 One Deags in CS:GO.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:39.120
Kicking off our list is Coldzera at IEM Oakland 2016

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:44.500
Cold caught an attacking RPK with the
deag before showing a falling Shox

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.620
why he’s one of the best players in the world.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:01:00.460
(Casting)

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:07.500
At number nine, we've got NiKo’s 3k against G2 at Dreamhack Cluj-Napoca 2015.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:14.840
The Bosnian superstar used his trusty deag to completely shut down an onslaught of G2 players.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:29.800
(Casting)

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:36.660
Coming in at number eight, is Autimatic versus compLexity at DreamHack Montreal 2017.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:43.860
Autimatic showed off his stealth skills while taking A site, catching two off-guard CTs with one deag.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:50.640
He followed that up by out aiming two more compLexity  players, grabbing himself four kills with only five shots.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:02:17.300
(Casting)

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:21.060
Next up is s1mple’s rotate at ESL One New York.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:28.400
S1mple surgically 1v1’d four Virtus.pro players to completely deflate their potential comeback.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:40.060
(Casting)

00:02:40.060 --> 00:03:03.180
(Casting)

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:08.340
Coming in at number six, another Autimatic clip, this time against Gambit.

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:15.040
The C9 player once again showed off some slick deags, dismantling the CIS team's buy round at

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.980
DreamHack Open Winter 2016.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:36.620
(Casting)

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:40.900
Coming in at number five, Kjaerbye’s Deagle clutch against Na`Vi.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:46.700
Just when Natus Vincere thought they could really pull away with the game, in comes Kjaerbye with the deagle.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:51.880
The Astralis player landed three one deags in a row, and proceeded to finish off Edward with the

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:56.560
headshot, securing the second round win in the last eleven.

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:30.520
(Casting)

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:36.960
At number four we’ve got Taco dismantling Astralis’ B push on Mirage.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:43.960
The SK Gaming player EVICTED the Danes from apartments with his superintendent Mr. D. Eagle.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:57.560
(Casting)

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:02.220
Coming in at number three we've got Dupreeh smothering FaZe Clan

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:07.120
at the IEM Katowice 2017 Grand Finals.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:14.220
Dupreeh completely derailed FaZe, taking on the whole team by himself with nothing but a trusty deagle.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:50.360
(Casting)

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:56.340
The runner-up on our list goes to NiKo once again, against Titan at ESL Pro League.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:06:03.540
The French team lined up for NiKo as he single handedly dropped the entire squad as they ran up highway

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.780
to their deaths.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:43.280
(Casting)

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:47.240
Capping off our list is Happy’s Deagle ace.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:50.300
What is there left to say about this incredible play?

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.660
We all know it, we all love it.

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:56.560
It’s Happy single handedly destroying TSM.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:07:36.280
(Casting)

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.320
Alright guys that’s our list.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:43.720
Now we know there are a lot of one deags out there, but those were the ten we thought were the spiciest.

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:47.720
If you've got an idea for a Top 10 list you'd like to see us do next time,

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:49.660
let us know in the comment section below.

